# Sins of the Father: a Saga's three chapters. I (as it enters): Bot2 sacrifices one nontoken creature of its choice - one
# of its three Ornithopters, while the 1/1 Warrior token Secure the Wastes made is not one (CR 701.21a) - so two
# Ornithopters and the token stay and only one card joins the graveyard. II (after Bot1's next draw step): one 2/1 red
# Klingon Warrior with haste for Bot1's one opponent (CR 608.2c). III (after the next draw step): exile target player's
# graveyard - Bot2's, holding the one creature card the sacrifice put there and a sorcery - and each opponent of Bot1 loses
# that much life: one (CR 406.2, 119.3). A creature is refused as that target: it is a player's graveyard. Then the Saga is
# sacrificed, having reached III (CR 714.4).

